            "object",
            "pose"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_conformal_keypoint_detection_turns_h",
          "text": "Conformal keypoint detection turns heatmap detections into circular or elliptical prediction sets that provably cover the true keypoints with a chosen probability, say ninety percent.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "conformal",
            "keypoint",
            "detection",
            "turns",
            "heatmap",
            "detections",
            "circular",
            "elliptical",
            "prediction",
            "sets"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_geometric_uncertainty_propagation_pu",
          "text": "Geometric uncertainty propagation pushes those sets through the geometry to form a Pose Uncertainty Set, or PURSE, covering the true pose.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "geometric",
            "uncertainty",
            "propagation",
            "pushes",
            "those",
            "sets",
            "through",
            "geometry",
            "form",
            "pose"
          ],
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c4_purse_they_compute_average_pose",
          "text": "From PURSE they compute an average pose and use semidefinite relaxation to bound the worst-case error. On LineMOD Occlusion, coverage is valid and the bounds hold.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "purse",
            "they",
            "compute",
            "average",
            "pose",
            "semidefinite",
