          "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_estimating_object_6_pose_image",
          "text": "Estimating an object's 6D pose from an image underlies augmented reality, autonomous driving, robotic manipulation, and space robotics.",
