          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c4_safety_critical_systems_serious_gap",
          "text": "For safety-critical systems that is a serious gap: no guarantee on the keypoints, no guarantee the optimizer found the right pose, and no formal bound on the worst-case error against the truth.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
