          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_certifying_optimizer_globally_optima",
          "text": "Certifying that the optimizer is globally optimal still gives no probabilistic guarantee on the pose itself. This paper delivers exactly that guarantee, end to end.",
